<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>HOMSelf 관리자 로그인</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/admin.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/admin_login.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-login-page">
<main class="admin-login-shell">
  <section class="admin-login-card">
    <a class="admin-login-brand" href="/main">HOMSelf</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">ADMIN</span>
    <h1>관리자 로그인</h1>
    <p>관리자 PIN을 입력하면 불출 관리 화면으로 이동합니다.</p>
    <form id="admin-login-form" class="admin-login-form">
      <input id="admin-pin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" placeholder="관리자 PIN 4자리" autocomplete="off" autofocus required>
      <button type="submit">관리자 화면 열기</button>
    </form>
    <p id="admin-login-message" class="admin-login-message" role="status"></p>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="/public/admin_login.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
